📣 Updated PHP Windows builds are now available:

- PHP 8.2.35-1
- PHP 8.3.36-1
- PHP 8.4.27-1
- PHP 8.5.12-1

‼️ These builds include Brotli 1.2.1 to fix CVE-2026-111497, an out-of-bounds write in Brotli decompression. This vulnerability is in the bundled Brotli library, not PHP code.

📝 Read more: https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-10-26-1

